('a33d3f0a-bbb0-4eb7-a00e-27aa00dad5ab', 'ELRESINLSPLATE', NULL, '(RESIDENTIAL) INSTALL NEW LIGHT SWITCH PLATE- Measure and cut a new aperture suitable for the new Light switch plate. Supply and install the appropriate cabling, equipment and terminations. Supply and install the new Light switch plate as required; meeting the manufacturer''s specifications.', 'Electrical', NULL, now()),
