('566902d6-ab32-4163-80b9-73ced686c1ef', 'Hot Water System', NULL, 'Electrical Connection of client supplied hot water system at required location. Supply and install suitable isolation, cabling, and circuit protection as required for the unit. Where required, provide suitable cutouts or mounting points for installation of associated switchgear; otherwise, fix via surface mounting. Supply and install all associated equipment, cabling, and terminations as required; ensuring compliance with manufacturer specifications and all relevant Australian standards and regulations.', 'Electrical', NULL, now()),
