('140769da-449f-4ea4-a34d-64376afd32a5', 'Track Light - Fittings', NULL, 'Supply and Installation of Track Light Fittings – Supply and install track-mounted light fixtures to the installed track system. Position and adjust fittings to achieve specified illumination and flexibility. Connect, test, and commission fittings to ensure correct operation. All works to be carried out in accordance with manufacturer’s specifications and all relevant Australian Standards and regulations.', 'Electrical', NULL, now()),
