('b669fcd2-2e40-4f56-9ba8-a9bba037d59b', 'AC Isolator', NULL, 'Supply and Installation of AC Isolator at required location. Where required, provide suitable cutouts for installation; otherwise, fix via surface mounting. Supply and install all associated equipment, cabling, and terminations as required; ensuring compliance with manufacturer specifications and all relevant Australian standards and regulations.', 'Electrical', NULL, now()),
('dd2c4a8c-c509-4366-958e-36269df065c1', 'SOL-Sig-10sp', NULL, '(SOLAR) SUPPLY & INSTALL 10kW SINGLE-PHASE SIGENERGY INVERTER
Supply and install one 10kW single-phase Sigenergy inverter as part of a new solar PV installation. Mount the inverter in a suitable location, install all required AC and DC cabling, protection devices, isolators and associated accessories required for a standard installation. Complete all electrical connections, program and commission the inverter, and test the system to ensure safe and correct operation in accordance with applicable Australian Standards and network requirements.

Price includes supply of one 10kW single-phase Sigenergy inverter, standard installation, commissioning and testing.

No allowance for switchboard upgrades, network application fees, internet/Wi-Fi configuration, battery installation, monitoring setup, trenching, or any additional electrical works or materials not specified above.', 'Electrical', NULL, now()),
('3de8254d-916b-4605-9480-b81b06d0b2d7', 'Garden Light', NULL, 'Supply and Installation of Garden Lighting – Supply and install all necessary cabling, supports, and fittings suitable for external use, including weatherproof connections and protection as required. Install and secure garden light fittings in position, ensuring correct alignment and spacing for effective coverage. Test and commission the installation to ensure safe and reliable operation. All works to be carried out in accordance with manufacturer’s specifications and in full compliance with all relevant Australian Standards and regulations.', 'Electrical', NULL, now()),
('1c81a9b1-f572-4693-83f7-9c331d16d22b', 'ELRESIRUNONTIMER', NULL, '(RESIDENTIAL) INSTALL RUN-ON TIMER – Install run-on timer mechanism within the wall cavity. Supply and install the appropriate cabling, equipment and terminations. Supply and install the new run-on timer as required; meeting the manufacturer’s specifications and current Australian standards.', 'Electrical', NULL, now()),
('e8cf4dc1-4a54-4b6c-8cd9-82df0c9184ae', 'ELINSDCI', NULL, 'INSTALL NEW SOLAR DC CIRCUIT INSTALLATION (LINEAR METER) - Measure and cut a new aperture suitable for the new Solar DC circuit Installation. Supply and install the appropriate cabling and terminations. Supply and install the new Solar DC circuit Installation as required; meeting the manufacturer''s specifications.', 'Electrical', NULL, now()),
('cce4b621-ac7e-4547-bdbf-664c486e9590', 'Smoke Alarm', NULL, 'Supply and Installation of smoke alarm - Measure and cut a new aperture suitable for the new smoke alarm. Supply and install the appropriate cabling and terminations. Supply and install the new smoke alarm as required; meeting the manufacturer''s specifications.', 'Electrical', NULL, now()),
('53969165-8f26-4201-8b47-3c2ef11abf7b', 'GPOWP10', NULL, 'Supply and Installation of Weatherproof double 10a Power Point - Measure and cut a new aperture suitable for the new double 10a Power Point. Supply and install the appropriate equipment and terminations. Supply and install the new double 10a Power Point as required; meeting the manufacturer''s specifications.', 'Electrical', NULL, now()),
('d261d0da-3ac7-41a7-bc0f-772b725624cc', 'ELRESINPCIC', NULL, '(RESIDENTIAL) INSTALL NEW POWER CIRCUIT IN CONDUIT (PER METER) - Measure and cut a new aperture suitable for the new power circuit in conduit. Supply and install the appropriate cabling and terminations. Supply and install the new power circuit in conduit as required; meeting the manufacturer''s specifications.', 'Electrical', NULL, now()),
('00c08033-0343-4dac-bb5f-402cde01b302', 'RCBO', NULL, '(RESIDENTIAL) INSTALL NEW RCBO - Supply and install a new RCBO suitable for the existing circuit. Verify circuit rating and compatibility, ensuring protection type aligns with AS/NZS requirements. Terminate conductors to manufacturer specifications and test operation. Label the RCBO and updated protective device schedule as required.', 'Electrical', NULL, now()),
('ee7d90bd-4efa-4706-a1e1-ae7c195363de', 'ELRESILEDSTRIP', NULL, 'Supply and Installation of LED Strip Light – Measure and prepare the installation location suitable for the new LED strip light. Supply and install the appropriate cabling, power supply/driver, mounting accessories, and terminations as required. Supply and install the LED strip light to the nominated location; installed and commissioned in accordance with the manufacturer’s specifications and Australian Standards.', 'Electrical', NULL, now()),
('4131c038-6394-4af2-8df1-12f29acd747d', 'ELRESINLC ', NULL, '(RESIDENTIAL) INSTALL NEW LIGHT CIRCUIT (PER METER) - Measure and cut a new aperture suitable for the new light circuit. Supply and install the appropriate cabling and terminations. Supply and install the new light circuit as required; meeting the manufacturer''s specifications.', 'Electrical', NULL, now()),
('1a714a0f-7be9-4e7f-bf2f-04ffce1a7ce6', 'ELRESINLDIM', NULL, '(RESIDENTIAL) INSTALL NEW LIGHT DIMMER- Install New Light Dimmer. Supply and install the appropriate cabling, equipment and terminations. Supply and install the new Light Dimmer as required; meeting the manufacturer''s specifications.', 'Electrical', NULL, now()),
('428791c1-7738-4d73-a4e6-505c19b9225c', 'Highbay', NULL, 'Supply and Installation of High Bay Light – Determine suitable mounting location and install suspension via jack chain or other approved hanging system. Supply and install all necessary cabling, supports, and terminations. Securely mount and connect the high bay light fitting at the appropriate height and position to achieve optimal illumination. All works to be carried out in accordance with manufacturer’s specifications and in full compliance with all relevant Australian Standards and regulations.', 'Electrical', NULL, now()),
('63070641-ace8-4568-9c75-06d8da6dad1d', 'Motion Sensor', NULL, 'Supply and Installation of Motion Sensor - Measure and cut a new aperture suitable for the new Motion Sensor. Supply and install the appropriate cabling and terminations. Supply and install the new Motion Sensor as required; meeting the manufacturer''s specifications.', 'Electrical', NULL, now());

